    "input": "search_document: Hello,\n\nThank you for reaching out to Northwind Outdoor. I understand your concern regarding the missing 15% bundle discount on your recent purchase of a tent, sleeping bag, and camping stove.\n\nAccording to our handbook, the 15% bundle discount is valid **only when all three specific items (tent, sleeping bag, and camp stove) are added to the cart simultaneously** [discounts]. If any item is removed from the cart before checkout, the discount is voided, and items are charged at standard retail prices [discounts]. Additionally, this promotion **does not apply to clearance items or limited-edition gear** [discounts].\n\nTo help determine why the discount was not applied, please check the following:\n1. Were all three items in your cart at the same time when you checked out?\n2. Were any of the items marked as \"clearance\" or \"limited edition\"?\n\nIf you confirm that all three items were in the cart simultaneously and none were clearance or limited-edition items, this may be a system error. Since I cannot access your specific order details or modify transactions directly, I recommend escalating this ticket to a human agent who can review your order history and apply the correct discount or issue a refund for the difference if eligible.\n\nWould you like me to escalate this to a human agent for further review?",
